            <div xml:id="d343">

                <pb facs="0485" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1931v03/pg375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/2472: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Forbes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-11-05T16:00:00+09:00">November 5, 1931—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 5—6:57 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>206. Your 218, November 4, 5 p.m. At 3 p.m. today I delivered the memorandum. My
                    talk with the Foreign Minister was long and conciliatory; I shall transmit a
                    summary later.<anchor n="55" xml:id="d343-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Forbes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
